The native MLX runtime that serves the Laya decision model lives in
xsoulspace_inference_mlx_native (see that package's NOTICE): it ports the
architecture of laya-mlx (https://github.com/mizorewww/laya-mlx, Apache-2.0),
which itself converts Laya (https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya,
Apache-2.0, by Convai Innovations and contributors). Model weights are
fetched separately from aac6fef/laya-mlx (Apache-2.0) and are never
redistributed by these packages. MLX and mlx-swift are Apple software
(MIT/Apache-2.0).
